@@ -307,14 +307,14 @@ Note: New panels added or modified mostly not mentioned here for concision. See
 - Sevopedia — Improvements: Added a new sortable **Improvement Weights (Leaders) Chart**, showing **Weights**, **Count** per Weight, and **clickable Leader buttons** for each weight and improvement.
 - Sevopedia — Terrain: add new **Peak** add **Hill** entries (they were previously hidden in Base AdvCiv). Even though they technically are plot types, adding them helps show some information specific to these "terrains".
 - Sevopedia — Civilizations: Add **cities panel**. Add optional **grouping by Art style** (e.g. European, Asian).
-- Sevopedia — Leaders: New **AI Personality panel** with raw attributes and cross-leader comparisons, and optional **grouping by civilization (with an icon)**. See also [SevoPediaLeaderAIPValues.py](/Assets/Python/Contrib/Sevopedia/SevoPediaLeaderAIPValues.py). Beautify **Traits with icon characters**. Make a free promotion's UnitCombats span **in the same line** instead of taking too much vertical space, and **add a blank line between Traits** for readability. Also **add linking** to their **corresponding Sevopedia Traits entry**: change in [CvGameTextMgr.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvGameTextMgr.cpp). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5502+) Add **Attitude** (furious, annoyed, cautious, pleased, friendly) and **Action buttons** (noanim/idle, greeting, agree, disagree). On click, the animation changes its behaviour to that of the buttons clicked. Also added a clickable **"Legend"** (can be hidden) link that **redirects** to Sevopedia Concepts' corresponding legend. See also: [How to read the AI Personality panel](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_AI_Personality_Panel.md#displaying-the-ai-attributes-in-the-ai-personality-panel-and-how-to-read-the-tablespanels).
